  "uie1fb894bb078": "Choose the project and questionnaire, answer the questions, follow required fields and validation messages, then save. Conditional questions follow the XLSForm rules supported by the importer. Review import warnings before fieldwork. Date questions use the date picker. Field quality checks list only saved GPS/photo readings above your selected accuracy review limit. Use Accept accuracy to keep a suitable reading and hide that finding permanently on this device, or View record to inspect it. The limit and decisions are saved per project; Undo restores a just-accepted finding. This does not block photos or alter data. Save drafts to resume incomplete interviews.",
  "@uie1fb894bb078": {
    "description": "Choose the project and questionnaire, answer the questions, follow required fields and validation messages, then save. Conditional questions follow the XLSForm rules supported by the importer. Review import warnings before fieldwork. Date questions use the date picker. Field quality checks list only saved GPS/photo readings above your selected accuracy review limit. Use Accept accuracy to keep a suitable reading and hide that finding permanently on this device, or View record to inspect it. The limit and decisions are saved per project; Undo restores a just-accepted finding. This does not block photos or alter data. Save drafts to resume incomplete interviews."
  },
  "ui58167ff8f947": "Edit survey/choices/settings cells in Google Sheets. In the app, select the project → Survey Mode → Sync questionnaire → Check Google Sheet → review → Apply update. New interviews and attribute editors use the new questions. Existing saved records and drafts retain their original form version. Updates require internet; collection remains offline.\n\nOne online XLSForm is served per project by this script; other locally imported forms remain available. Change the displayed label freely, but keep existing question names and form_id stable. Removing/renaming questions can change how historical answers are interpreted. Check warnings and pilot every revised questionnaire before field deployment.",
  "@ui58167ff8f947": {
    "description": "Edit survey/choices/settings cells in Google Sheets. In the app, select the project → Survey Mode → Sync questionnaire → Check Google Sheet → review → Apply update. New interviews and attribute editors use the new questions. Existing saved records and drafts retain their original form version. Updates require internet; collection remains offline.\n\nOne online XLSForm is served per project by this script; other locally imported forms remain available. Change the displayed label freely, but keep existing question names and form_id stable. Removing/renaming questions can change how historical answers are interpreted. Check warnings and pilot every revised questionnaire before field deployment."
  },
