  "uibf3148392176": "GPS Mode is independent of projects. It provides location diagnostics and recording. Its compass uses orientation sensors relative to magnetic north, with GPS travel bearing explicitly labelled as a fallback; keep the phone flat and calibrate away from metal when prompted. GNSS altitude is an absolute satellite estimate, not height above your building’s ground floor; indoor reception can give unreliable altitude. Check outdoor reception and vertical accuracy where available.\n\nPhotos require a valid location for geotagging. Accuracy is recorded for review but a strict accuracy threshold does not block taking a photo. Allow location and camera permissions, and give the device time to acquire a location.",
  "@uibf3148392176": {
    "description": "GPS Mode is independent of projects. It provides location diagnostics and recording. Its compass uses orientation sensors relative to magnetic north, with GPS travel bearing explicitly labelled as a fallback; keep the phone flat and calibrate away from metal when prompted. GNSS altitude is an absolute satellite estimate, not height above your building’s ground floor; indoor reception can give unreliable altitude. Check outdoor reception and vertical accuracy where available.\n\nPhotos require a valid location for geotagging. Accuracy is recorded for review but a strict accuracy threshold does not block taking a photo. Allow location and camera permissions, and give the device time to acquire a location."
  },
