  "ui8762dae21dde": "Manager: create a project, import its XLSForm, select a questionnaire and add study-area maps. Configure the cloud connection if needed. Export/share the project package with “Include sync connection” selected for trusted enumerators.\n\nEnumerator: Home → three-bar menu → My name. Import the project package and select it. Survey Mode → Sync questionnaire checks for updated questions. Collect offline in Survey Mode, GIS Mode or Visit a study site. Home → three-bar menu → My responses lets you review and edit saved responses. Home → Cloud Sync uploads new records and corrections when connected. Each correction keeps the original collector and stable ID, records the editor and advances the response revision; it is separate from questionnaire version. The same project and questions are used in GIS and Study Area modes. GPS Mode works independently.",
  "@ui8762dae21dde": {
    "description": "Manager: create a project, import its XLSForm, select a questionnaire and add study-area maps. Configure the cloud connection if needed. Export/share the project package with “Include sync connection” selected for trusted enumerators.\n\nEnumerator: Home → three-bar menu → My name. Import the project package and select it. Survey Mode → Sync questionnaire checks for updated questions. Collect offline in Survey Mode, GIS Mode or Visit a study site. Home → three-bar menu → My responses lets you review and edit saved responses. Home → Cloud Sync uploads new records and corrections when connected. Each correction keeps the original collector and stable ID, records the editor and advances the response revision; it is separate from questionnaire version. The same project and questions are used in GIS and Study Area modes. GPS Mode works independently."
  },
