  "ui1a25286391c7": "Select the project and one of its study-area maps. Import from the top toolbar; GeoJSON and GeoPackage can be selected regardless of Android MIME filtering. ZIP shapefile companions together for attributes. Files opened externally offer an existing project, new project or view-only preview. Add new Layer is inside the study-layer selector; the plus button opens the questionnaire at a fresh GPS position. Edit feature requires a questionnaire for new/Updated features; other statuses have an optional Fill questionnaire checkbox. Skipping keeps previous answers. Categories & colors includes Verification status coloring and starts with a single color and lets you explicitly choose a column, category colors/visibility and point size.  Use separate named maps for salinity rounds, household verification or the full study area. Start/resume a field visit for that selected area. Verify existing sites, record new information or update attributes using the selected questionnaire. Visit history preserves the review trail. Assign old unassigned sites to a project explicitly. Export the updated area after fieldwork.",
  "@ui1a25286391c7": {
    "description": "Select the project and one of its study-area maps. Import from the top toolbar; GeoJSON and GeoPackage can be selected regardless of Android MIME filtering. ZIP shapefile companions together for attributes. Files opened externally offer an existing project, new project or view-only preview. Add new Layer is inside the study-layer selector; the plus button opens the questionnaire at a fresh GPS position. Edit feature requires a questionnaire for new/Updated features; other statuses have an optional Fill questionnaire checkbox. Skipping keeps previous answers. Categories & colors includes Verification status coloring and starts with a single color and lets you explicitly choose a column, category colors/visibility and point size.  Use separate named maps for salinity rounds, household verification or the full study area. Start/resume a field visit for that selected area. Verify existing sites, record new information or update attributes using the selected questionnaire. Visit history preserves the review trail. Assign old unassigned sites to a project explicitly. Export the updated area after fieldwork."
  },
  "ui3ba9b97177d2": "Select the project, layer and survey. Add a point, line or polygon, then enter information using the selected survey questions. Existing geometry can be edited and its attributes updated. Define questions in the selected survey form; the separate Project Settings field editor has been removed, while old field values remain stored. Use consistent identifiers to connect a feature with a site or repeat visit. Export spatial data when you need analysis in GIS software.",
  "@ui3ba9b97177d2": {
    "description": "Select the project, layer and survey. Add a point, line or polygon, then enter information using the selected survey questions. Existing geometry can be edited and its attributes updated. Define questions in the selected survey form; the separate Project Settings field editor has been removed, while old field values remain stored. Use consistent identifiers to connect a feature with a site or repeat visit. Export spatial data when you need analysis in GIS software."
  },
