  "uib71084f5010f": "Project packages share definitions, questionnaires, layers and setup. Select Include collected responses and photos when those records should travel too; a setup-only package is not a backup of collected data. Include sync connection adds the URL and API key for trusted field teams. Keep the same project identity across the team. Creating a new copy gives it a separate identity and backend setup.\n\nKeep backups outside the phone. Installing an update over the same signed app preserves local storage; uninstalling or clearing app storage removes local data. Save cloud connection settings before exporting.",
  "@uib71084f5010f": {
    "description": "Project packages share definitions, questionnaires, layers and setup. Select Include collected responses and photos when those records should travel too; a setup-only package is not a backup of collected data. Include sync connection adds the URL and API key for trusted field teams. Keep the same project identity across the team. Creating a new copy gives it a separate identity and backend setup.\n\nKeep backups outside the phone. Installing an update over the same signed app preserves local storage; uninstalling or clearing app storage removes local data. Save cloud connection settings before exporting."
  },
